sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Administrator
    participant API as FRMS Timetable API
    participant Validator as Overlap Validator
    participant Store as Timetable Store
    participant Viewer as Public Schedule Viewer
    actor Student

    Admin->>API: Enter or import semester timetable
    API->>Validator: Check resource and lecturer overlaps

    alt Overlap detected
        Validator-->>API: List conflicting slots
        API-->>Admin: Return validation errors
    else No overlap
        Validator-->>API: Slots valid
        API->>Store: Lock validated slots
        Store-->>API: Lock confirmed
        API->>Viewer: Publish locked schedule
        Viewer-->>Student: Display published timetable
    end
